        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In fiscal year 2025, our private label sales represented 28.1% of total merchandise sales, up from 27.6% for fiscal year 2024, and we plan to continue to invest in the development of additional private label products under the “Member’s Selection®” brand.",
